{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1540150-v20-lucky-merit","id":1540150,"title":"[V20] Lucky Merit?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-10T16:06:34-07:00","id":1540150,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> [V20] Lucky Merit?","content":"How do you treat the Lucky merit?<br /> Do you allow the player to re-roll a failed die, or re-roll the entire roll by itself?<br /> <br /> I was reading the description of the same merit on MTA, and I did get the impression that it is referring to specific dice rather than the entire roll.<br /> Meaning players can re-roll a <b>single</b> failed/botched die even on a successful roll, for the chance of getting an extra success.<br /> <br /> <b>V20</b><br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YJ78PHe.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/YJ78PHe.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/YJ78PHe.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> <b>M20</b><br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M77GsYc.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/M77GsYc.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/M77GsYc.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25177-lirbo","name":"Lirbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25177_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-10T17:11:35-07:00","id":1540155,"title":"","content":"Both refer to re-rolling a <i>roll</i>, not a <i>dice</i>. Even the M20 version says <i>die <u>roll</u></i>, not just die.<br /> <br /> I don't see any way to interpret this as rolling just the dice you want, it is clearly about remaking the whole roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-10T17:27:53-07:00","id":1540156,"title":"","content":"Also just logic, its a 3 dot merit if you could only reroll three dice in a story that would be substantially weaker. Like three rolls you can calibrate a number of things, a success or a failure can change things and some times just avoiding a botch is enough to change a lot of how events can play out. But only rolling a single die just isn't that strong because the only chance it would have of doing anything would be edge cases where a single die changes the results and that doesn't come up as often.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}